<?php $historyActions=['created'=>'Création','updated'=>'Modification','archived'=>'Archivage','restored'=>'Restauration','validation.approved'=>'Validation','validation.rejected'=>'Reprise demandée','time.created'=>'Temps ajouté','time.updated'=>'Temps modifié','time.deleted'=>'Temps supprimé']; ?>
<section id="history" class="panel tracking-panel" data-ticket-panel data-ticket-live aria-labelledby="ticket-tab-history" hidden><div class="panel-header"><div><h2>Historique détaillé</h2><p>Auteur, date et valeurs avant/après chaque modification depuis l’activation du suivi.</p></div><?= icon('clock') ?></div>
<?php foreach($history['entries'] as $event): ?><article class="history-entry"><header><strong><?= e($historyActions[$event['action']]??$event['action']) ?></strong><span><?= e($event['actor_name']??'Système / demande externe') ?></span><time><?= e($event['created_at']) ?> UTC</time></header><small>Version <?= (int)$event['ticket_version'] ?> · <?= e($event['source']) ?></small><dl class="history-changes"><?php foreach($event['changes'] as $change): ?><div><dt><?= e($change['label']) ?></dt><dd><?php if($change['field']==='description' || mb_strlen($change['before_label'].$change['after_label'])>500): ?><details><summary>Voir les valeurs</summary><?php endif; ?><div class="history-before"><small>Avant</small><span><?= e($change['before_label']) ?></span></div><div class="history-after"><small>Après</small><span><?= e($change['after_label']) ?></span></div><?php if($change['field']==='description' || mb_strlen($change['before_label'].$change['after_label'])>500): ?></details><?php endif; ?></dd></div><?php endforeach; ?></dl></article><?php endforeach; if(!$history['entries']): ?><p class="empty-state">Aucune modification enregistrée depuis l’activation de l’historique détaillé. Les anciennes activités restent dans la vue d’ensemble.</p><?php endif; ?>
<?php if($history['total']>$history['limit']): ?><nav class="pagination" aria-label="Pages de l’historique"><?php if($history['offset']): ?><a class="button subtle" href="<?= e(ticket_url((int)$ticket['id'],'#history',['history_offset'=>max(0,$history['offset']-$history['limit'])])) ?>">Plus récentes</a><?php endif; ?><span><?= $history['offset']+1 ?>–<?= min($history['total'],$history['offset']+$history['limit']) ?> sur <?= $history['total'] ?></span><?php if($history['offset']+$history['limit']<$history['total']): ?><a class="button subtle" href="<?= e(ticket_url((int)$ticket['id'],'#history',['history_offset'=>($history['offset']+$history['limit'])])) ?>">Plus anciennes</a><?php endif; ?></nav><?php endif; ?></section>
